title: Checkmk Known Catalog
agents: linux, windows
catalog: app/checkmk
license: GPLv2
distribution:
description:
 Read-only reference service that lists the application types the Monitoring
 Compliance detection knows about (its built-in alias, signature and title
 tables), annotated with whether a covering check plug-in is currently
 available on this site. It is informational and always {OK}.

 Unlike the capability database, this service does not reflect observed host
 state; it is a static reference of the detection knowledge. It is created when
 "Report known catalog" is enabled in the special-agent rule on a host.

 Metrics: known_catalog_total, known_catalog_available.

item:
 No item. One service per reporting host.

discovery:
 One service "Checkmk Known Catalog" is created when the special agent emits
 the known-catalog section.
